### FlowForge API — M3 read endpoints
### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension, or copy each URL into curl.
### Start the server first: pnpm --filter=@flowforge/server dev

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

### Health — should show db.ok true once DATABASE_URL is set and migrated/seeded; redis.ok is false until M5 by design.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Stats overview — the four Overview counters, 24 hourly activity buckets, top 5 workers by inflight, 10 most recent runs.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/overview

### All jobs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs

### Jobs filtered by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs?status=active

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs?status=paused

### One job, with its config (should be churn-model-retrain, status paused)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/churn-model-retrain

### A job that doesn't exist — expect 404 JOB_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/does-not-exist

### Run history for one job, first page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/docs-embedding-index/runs?limit=10

### Run history for one job, second page (paste a nextCursor value from the previous response)
# GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/docs-embedding-index/runs?limit=10&cursor=PASTE_NEXT_CURSOR_HERE

### A malformed cursor — expect a clean 400 INVALID_CURSOR, not a crash
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/docs-embedding-index/runs?cursor=not-a-real-cursor

### Recent runs across all jobs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/runs?limit=20

### Recent runs filtered by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/runs?status=dead_letter

### One run — paste a real run id from a previous response
# GET {{baseUrl}}/api/runs/PASTE_RUN_ID_HERE

### A run that doesn't exist — expect 404 RUN_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/runs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Log lines for a run — paste a real run id
# GET {{baseUrl}}/api/runs/PASTE_RUN_ID_HERE/logs

### Worker fleet — 8 workers, one (worker-08) should read status "offline" (stale heartbeat)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workers

### Failure clusters, default 24h window — should show docs-embedding-index's rate_limit cluster prominently
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/failures/clusters

### Failure clusters, wider window to catch more of the 30-day seed history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/failures/clusters?windowHours=720

### Failure clusters scoped to one job
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/failures/clusters?jobId=docs-embedding-index

### An unknown route — expect 404 NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/this-route-does-not-exist
